<title>USA: Illinova files for $300 mln shelf debt.</title>
<headline>Illinova files for $300 mln shelf debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Illinova Corp filed Friday with the Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration for up to $300 million in senior debt securities.</p>
<p>Illinova said net proceeds will be used to repay debt or for other general corporate pruposes, including loans to or investments in its operating subsidiaries.</p>
<p>Illinova is a Decatur, Ill.,-based holding company for Illinois Power Co, Illinova Generating Co, Illinova Power Marketing Inc and Illinova Energy Partners Inc.</p>
</text>
